at we know but there's a lot we don't  know I do have quite a few more  questions so I'm actually going to split  this up and do a Q&amp;A part two that I'll  upload a little bit later so I don't  answer your question now try answer it  then but also I'll try and answer it  online thanks for watching and thanks  for sending in so many questions I'll  see you next time

